        "Content": "<ul><li> Approximately 198 sqm of accommodation arranged over three floors. </li><li> Modern semi-detached home, built in 2023, with an A2 BER. </li><li> Five bedrooms, with a flexible first-floor room offering a sixth-bedroom option. </li><li> Separate living room, first-floor children`s reception / home office and additional top-floor home office. </li><li> Shaker-style kitchen with quartz worktops and NEFF appliances. </li><li> Kitchen and dining room opening directly onto the rear garden. </li><li> Separate utility room and ground-floor guest WC. </li><li> Primary bedroom with walk-in wardrobe and en suite, plus family bathroom and additional shower room. </li><li> Landscaped west-facing garden with lawn, paved patio and garden shed. </li><li> Paved driveway parking and a cul-de-sac setting in Kilternan.</li></ul>"
